1
00:00:00,579 --> 00:00:01,619
(Leonard:)What happened?

2
00:00:01,789 --> 00:00:05,919
Remember when I auditioned for Rent but
I didn't get it and I couldn't figure out why?

3
00:00:06,085 --> 00:00:08,085
(Sheldon:)I have a conclusion
based on an observation.

4
00:00:08,254 --> 00:00:09,294
(Leonard:)No, you don't.

5
00:00:09,463 --> 00:00:10,753
(Leonard:)No, he doesn't.

6
00:00:11,215 --> 00:00:14,845
The girl picked to play Mimi, she dropped
out and they asked me to replace her.

7
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:17,800
- Oh! Congratulations, what a lucky break.
- It's not a big deal.

8
00:00:17,972 --> 00:00:20,722
Just one night,
but they invite casting people and agents.

9
00:00:20,891 --> 00:00:21,931
(Penny:)So you never know.

10
00:00:22,101 --> 00:00:24,561
- I think I know.
- No, you don't.

11
00:00:25,104 --> 00:00:28,194
(Leonard:)- He doesn't.
- It's this Friday at 8, you guys wanna come?

12
00:00:28,357 --> 00:00:29,527
(Leonard:)- No.
- No.

13
00:00:31,193 --> 00:00:36,073
Because Friday,
we are attending a symposium...

14
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:37,820
(Leonard:)...on molecular positronium.

15
00:00:37,992 --> 00:00:41,122
- I think that's a week from Tuesday at 6.
- No, it's this Friday.

16
00:00:41,704 --> 00:00:44,414
- At 8.
- Oh, too bad.

17
00:00:44,582 --> 00:00:46,872
- I gotta get to rehearsal. See you guys.
- See you.

18
00:00:47,126 --> 00:00:52,256
PENNY [SINGING]:
Let's go out tonight

19
00:00:52,798 --> 00:00:54,928
- You just lied to Penny.
- Yes, I did.

20
00:00:55,092 --> 00:00:56,422
(Sheldon:)And you did it so casually.

21
00:00:56,594 --> 00:00:59,554
(Sheldon:)No rapid breathing,
no increase in perspiration.

22
00:00:59,722 --> 00:01:01,932
- So?
- So lack of a physiological response...

23
00:01:02,099 --> 00:01:05,939
(Sheldon:)...while lying
is characteristic of a violent sociopath.

24
00:01:06,103 --> 00:01:08,393
(Leonard:)Sheldon, are you worried
about your safety?

25
00:01:08,564 --> 00:01:12,694
(Sheldon:)No. I imagine if you were going to kill me,
you'd have done it a long time ago.

26
00:01:13,110 --> 00:01:35,020
(Leonard:)That's very true.

